 Test_GETEvents_HasVideos_Invalid←{
⍝ Test that an unrecognised ?has_videos value gives 400, and that omitting it still returns all events
     H←##.##.##.HttpCommand
     Assert←##.Assert
     'An unrecognised has_videos value must be 400'Assert 400=(H.Get ⍵,'/events?has_videos=banana').HttpStatus:
     all←H.GetJSON'GET'(⍵,'/events')
     'Expected 200 OK from /events'Assert 200=all.HttpStatus:
     'Omitting has_videos must return all events'Assert 0<≢all.Data:
     1
 }
